# Environment configuration for the replication package.
#
# This project reads no credentials or API keys: the raw and processed data are
# local files (see data/README.md), and every path resolves relative to the
# repository root through src/common/paths.py. No secrets are required to run
# reproduce.py.
#
# Optional path overrides, if you keep the data outside the repository. Each
# defaults to a folder under ./data (see src/common/paths.py); set only the ones
# you relocate.
#
#   MICRODIFFUSION_DATA_DIR    root data directory (default: ./data)
#   MICRODIFFUSION_CRYPTO_DIR  Appendix E cryptocurrency feed (default: <data>/crypto)
#   MICRODIFFUSION_US_DIR      Appendix F United States L1 panel (default: <data>/us_itch)
#
# MICRODIFFUSION_DATA_DIR=
# MICRODIFFUSION_CRYPTO_DIR=
# MICRODIFFUSION_US_DIR=
